        <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-2.5">New Regime Slabs (FY 2024-25 / 2025-26)</div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-1.5 font-mono">
          <span>₹0 - ₹3,00,000:</span><span class="text-right text-[var(--color-accent-emerald)]">Nil (0%)</span>
          <span>₹3,00,001 - ₹7,00,000:</span><span class="text-right">5%</span>
          <span>₹7,00,001 - ₹10,00,000:</span><span class="text-right">10%</span>
          <span>₹10,00,001 - ₹12,00,000:</span><span class="text-right">15%</span>
          <span>₹12,00,001 - ₹15,00,000:</span><span class="text-right">20%</span>
          <span>Above ₹15,00,000:</span><span class="text-right text-[var(--color-accent-rose)]">30%</span>
